{"findMembers() starts without waiting, allowing race condition where late initial request response can overwrite newer page selection if user clicks next before initial request finishes": 0.7801229953765869, "Page count calculation has off-by-one error when user_count is exact multiple of limit, showing one page too many and allowing navigation to empty page": 0.8485560417175293, "Public members view returns only the first page (50 members) for visible non-automatic groups with no pagination controls, making remaining members unreachable from /groups/:name/members": 0.9273236989974976, "Member removal uses group.users.delete(user_id) instead of Group#remove, bypassing the GroupUser counter cache and leaving groups.user_count stale": 0.6102845072746277, "Automatic state check in member item template may resolve against the rendered user item instead of parent group, causing remove link to appear for automatic groups and resulting in 422 error when clicked": 0.7206368446350098}